  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:05.910" end="00:09.320" ttm:agent="v1">Aw yeah, testin' one two, one two</p>
      <p begin="00:09.320" end="00:12.100" ttm:agent="v1">This a lil somethin' for you, you lil biatch!</p>
      <p begin="00:12.100" end="00:15.360" ttm:agent="v1">Watch my 9mm go, &quot;bang!&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:15.360" end="00:18.230" ttm:agent="v1">Wadadadang, wadadadadang</p>
      <p begin="00:18.230" end="00:21.240" ttm:agent="v1">Watch my 9mm go, &quot;bang!&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:21.240" end="00:24.250" ttm:agent="v1">Wadadadang, wadadadadang,</p>
      <p begin="00:24.250" end="00:25.750" ttm:agent="v1">Player haters, masturbators</p>
      <p begin="00:25.610" end="00:27.110" ttm:agent="v1">Bitches all up in my shit</p>
      <p begin="00:27.110" end="00:28.840" ttm:agent="v1">Livin' scared, you know you dead</p>
      <p begin="00:28.840" end="00:30.340" ttm:agent="v1">Walkin' around with a crippled leg</p>
      <p begin="00:30.310" end="00:32.040" ttm:agent="v1">That bitch boy try to test my shit</p>
      <p begin="00:32.040" end="00:33.540" ttm:agent="v1">Fucking with the rizzo click</p>
      <p begin="00:33.530" end="00:35.370" ttm:agent="v1">M-A-G-N-O-L-I-A</p>
      <p begin="00:35.370" end="00:36.870" ttm:agent="v1">That is where yo' ass will lay</p>
      <p begin="00:36.810" end="00:38.310" ttm:agent="v1">You player haters on my dick</p>
      <p begin="00:38.240" end="00:39.740" ttm:agent="v1">Trying to put me in a click</p>
      <p begin="00:39.720" end="00:41.440" ttm:agent="v1">I'll buck you twice, I'll buck one more</p>
      <p begin="00:41.440" end="00:42.940" ttm:agent="v1">All you cowards hit the floor</p>
      <p begin="00:42.710" end="00:44.240" ttm:agent="v1">These jealous fellas in a gang</p>
      <p begin="00:44.240" end="00:45.990" ttm:agent="v1">Knowin' that they ass is lame</p>
      <p begin="00:45.990" end="00:47.490" ttm:agent="v1">Big ass smile, but still as lame</p>
      <p begin="00:47.410" end="00:48.910" ttm:agent="v1">You got a Glock, so buck me bitch</p>
      <p begin="00:48.880" end="00:50.690" ttm:agent="v1">When that smoke is in my nose</p>
      <p begin="00:50.690" end="00:52.190" ttm:agent="v1">I be wantin' to kidnap hoes</p>
      <p begin="00:52.150" end="00:53.650" ttm:agent="v1">Talkin' shit about Da Click</p>
      <p begin="00:53.540" end="00:55.400" ttm:agent="v1">You gon get yo ass kicked</p>
      <p begin="00:55.400" end="00:56.900" ttm:agent="v1">I hop out my fuckin' ridе</p>
      <p begin="00:56.850" end="00:58.350" ttm:agent="v1">And put my Glock to yo' side</p>
      <p begin="00:58.220" end="00:59.720" ttm:agent="v1">Lock you in the fuckin' trunk</p>
      <p begin="00:59.600" end="01:01.750" ttm:agent="v1">And then I'll hit that blunt, nah</p>
      <p begin="01:01.750" end="01:04.930" ttm:agent="v1">Watch my 9mm go, &quot;bang!&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:04.930" end="01:07.930" ttm:agent="v1">Wadadadang, wadadadadang</p>
      <p begin="01:07.930" end="01:10.850" ttm:agent="v1">Watch my 9mm go, &quot;bang!&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:10.850" end="01:14.390" ttm:agent="v1">Wadadadang, wadadadadang,</p>
      <p begin="01:14.390" end="01:18.550" ttm:agent="v1">This a lil somethin' for you, you lil biatch!</p>
